---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Return & Refund Policy - Food Hacks"
  description="Food Hacks return and refund policy: replacements and refunds within 14 days, and manufacturing-defect resolution within 30 days."
>
  <PageHero title="Return & Refund Policy" subtitle="Fair and simple" />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl space-y-8 px-4 pb-24 pt-16">
    <!-- 14-day card -->
    <div class="tile reveal border-2 border-ink bg-white p-8 shadow-[8px_8px_0_rgba(141,191,68,0.9)] md:p-10">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
        <span class="display text-[clamp(40px,5vw,64px)] text-brand-deep" aria-hidden="true">14</span>
        <p class="font-head text-[19px] text-ink"><b>Replacement and Refund within 14 Days</b></p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5">
        If you changed your mind about your Food Hacks purchase, you can request a replacement or
        refund under the following conditions:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 marker:text-brand-deep">
        <li>Timeframe: Contact us within 14 days of purchase.</li>
        <li>Condition: Make sure your product is still in its original, unopened condition.</li>
        <li>Proof of Purchase: Have your receipt or proof of purchase handy.</li>
        <li>Shipping Fees: Please note that shipping fees are non-refundable.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5">
        To initiate a return or exchange, simply contact our customer service team with your order
        details and reason for return. We will guide you through the steps to return it again.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 30-day card -->
    <div class="on-dark tile reveal reveal-d1 mesh-navy relative overflow-hidden p-8 text-white md:p-10">
      <div class="dotgrid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
          <span class="display text-[clamp(40px,5vw,64px)] text-brand" aria-hidden="true">30</span>
          <p class="font-head text-[19px] text-white"><b>Manufacturing defect (within 30 days)</b></p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-5 text-white/85">
          We care about quality at Food Hacks. If you notice any manufacturing hiccups, we are here to
          make it right:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-white/85 marker:text-brand">
          <li>Timeframe: Let us know within 30 days of purchase.</li>
          <li>Condition: The issue must be related to a manufacturing defect.</li>
          <li>Proof of Purchase: Keep your receipt or proof of purchase handy.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-5 text-white/85">
          Send us a message with your order details and a description of the issue. Our team will
          provide instructions on how to fix the problem, whether it&rsquo;s a replacement or a refund..
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-white/85">
          To address a manufacturing issue, please contact our customer service team with a description
          of the problem and your order details. We will assess the issue and guide you through the
          next steps.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
